<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8" standalone="yes"?><rss version="2.0" xmlns:atom="http://www.w3.org/2005/Atom"><channel><title>Hangzhou on 酷玛阁 | KumaTea's Blog</title><link>https://blog.kmtea.eu/tags/hangzhou/</link><description>Recent content in Hangzhou on 酷玛阁 | KumaTea's Blog</description><generator>Hugo -- gohugo.io</generator><language>zh-cn</language><lastBuildDate>Fri, 04 Oct 2024 17:08:48 +0800</lastBuildDate><atom:link href="https://blog.kmtea.eu/tags/hangzhou/index.xml" rel="self" type="application/rss+xml"/><item><title>六月游记（一）</title><link>https://blog.kmtea.eu/p/240628-jun-travel-1/</link><pubDate>Sun, 15 Sep 2024 16:30:00 +0800</pubDate><guid>https://blog.kmtea.eu/p/240628-jun-travel-1/</guid><description>&lt;img src="https://blog.kmtea.eu/p/240628-jun-travel-1/img/cover.webp" alt="Featured image of post 六月游记（一）" /&gt;&lt;h1 id="六月游记一"&gt;六月游记（一）&#10;&lt;/h1&gt;&lt;p&gt;2024年6月杭州旅游记录&lt;/p&gt;&#10;&lt;h2 id="6月1日"&gt;6月1日&#10;&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;p&gt;起飞啦&lt;/p&gt;&#10;&lt;p&gt;CAN -&amp;gt; HGH&lt;/p&gt;&#10;&lt;p&gt;&lt;img class="gallery-image" data-flex-basis="320px" data-flex-grow="133" height="3000" loading="lazy" sizes="(max-width: 767px) calc(100vw - 30px), (max-width: 1023px) 700px, (max-width: 1279px) 950px, 1232px" src="https://blog.kmtea.eu/p/240628-jun-travel-1/img/20240601-113848.webp" srcset="https://blog.kmtea.eu/p/240628-jun-travel-1/img/20240601-113848_hu_4be4b43efe42e5d3.webp 800w, https://blog.kmtea.eu/p/240628-jun-travel-1/img/20240601-113848_hu_bc1ea34c1ec669a7.webp 1600w, https://blog.kmtea.eu/p/240628-jun-travel-1/img/20240601-113848_hu_76d6039690ff406b.webp 2400w, https://blog.kmtea.eu/p/240628-jun-travel-1/img/20240601-113848.webp 4000w" width="4000"&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&#10;&lt;p&gt;快降落时候的景色&lt;/p&gt;&#10;&lt;p&gt;&lt;img class="gallery-image" data-flex-basis="426px" data-flex-grow="177" height="2250" loading="lazy" sizes="(max-width: 767px) calc(100vw - 30px), (max-width: 1023px) 700px, (max-width: 1279px) 950px, 1232px" src="https://blog.kmtea.eu/p/240628-jun-travel-1/img/20240601-130105.webp" srcset="https://blog.kmtea.eu/p/240628-jun-travel-1/img/20240601-130105_hu_a6eb22bdc0c17752.webp 800w, https://blog.kmtea.eu/p/240628-jun-travel-1/img/20240601-130105_hu_2d4da71a69b58942.webp 1600w, https://blog.kmtea.eu/p/240628-jun-travel-1/img/20240601-130105_hu_38eeb571f0f558e8.webp 2400w, https://blog.kmtea.eu/p/240628-jun-travel-1/img/20240601-130105.webp 4000w" width="4000"&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&#10;&lt;p&gt;到机场了&lt;/p&gt;&#10;&lt;p&gt;后来回看照片，才发现当天是六一&lt;/p&gt;&#10;&lt;p&gt;&lt;img class="gallery-image" data-flex-basis="180px" data-flex-grow="75" height="4000" loading="lazy" sizes="(max-width: 767px) calc(100vw - 30px), (max-width: 1023px) 700px, (max-width: 1279px) 950px, 1232px" src="https://blog.kmtea.eu/p/240628-jun-travel-1/img/20240601-132900.webp" srcset="https://blog.kmtea.eu/p/240628-jun-travel-1/img/20240601-132900_hu_2c6f97dd5f861f96.webp 800w, https://blog.kmtea.eu/p/240628-jun-travel-1/img/20240601-132900_hu_c51dc57959dd278d.webp 1600w, https://blog.kmtea.eu/p/240628-jun-travel-1/img/20240601-132900_hu_62924f64c51c0bdd.webp 2400w, https://blog.kmtea.eu/p/240628-jun-travel-1/img/20240601-132900.webp 3000w" width="3000"&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&#10;&lt;p&gt;很好看，但是真的不会生蚊子吗&lt;/p&gt;&#10;&lt;p&gt;&lt;img class="gallery-image" data-flex-basis="320px" data-flex-grow="133" height="3000" loading="lazy" sizes="(max-width: 767px) calc(100vw - 30px), (max-width: 1023px) 700px, (max-width: 1279px) 950px, 1232px" src="https://blog.kmtea.eu/p/240628-jun-travel-1/img/20240601-133155.webp" srcset="https://blog.kmtea.eu/p/240628-jun-travel-1/img/20240601-133155_hu_e65266de25c7214a.webp 800w, https://blog.kmtea.eu/p/240628-jun-travel-1/img/20240601-133155_hu_1c9266e3a95e1b91.webp 1600w, https://blog.kmtea.eu/p/240628-jun-travel-1/img/20240601-133155_hu_3b0a13b59899a615.webp 2400w, https://blog.kmtea.eu/p/240628-jun-travel-1/img/20240601-133155.webp 4000w" width="4000"&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&#10;&lt;hr&gt;&#10;&lt;p&gt;这个时候跟图批面上了&lt;/p&gt;&#10;&lt;p&gt;第一站是西湖（东），一个不来后悔一辈子来了后悔一天的地方&lt;/p&gt;&#10;&lt;p&gt;&lt;img class="gallery-image" data-flex-basis="320px" data-flex-grow="133" height="3000" loading="lazy" sizes="(max-width: 767px) calc(100vw - 30px), (max-width: 1023px) 700px, (max-width: 1279px) 950px, 1232px" src="https://blog.kmtea.eu/p/240628-jun-travel-1/img/20240601-163443.webp" srcset="https://blog.kmtea.eu/p/240628-jun-travel-1/img/20240601-163443_hu_3369834f354099c5.webp 800w, https://blog.kmtea.eu/p/240628-jun-travel-1/img/20240601-163443_hu_e7b43b6ec82ca104.webp 1600w, https://blog.kmtea.eu/p/240628-jun-travel-1/img/20240601-163443_hu_226ff949c0433e3f.webp 2400w, https://blog.kmtea.eu/p/240628-jun-travel-1/img/20240601-163443.webp 4000w" width="4000"&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&#10;&lt;p&gt;逛了一圈，真就一个湖而已&lt;/p&gt;&#10;&lt;p&gt;以及每到一个城市必打卡的 Apple Store&lt;/p&gt;&#10;&lt;p&gt;&lt;img class="gallery-image" data-flex-basis="426px" data-flex-grow="177" height="2250" loading="lazy" sizes="(max-width: 767px) calc(100vw - 30px), (max-width: 1023px) 700px, (max-width: 1279px) 950px, 1232px" src="https://blog.kmtea.eu/p/240628-jun-travel-1/img/20240601-170112.webp" srcset="https://blog.kmtea.eu/p/240628-jun-travel-1/img/20240601-170112_hu_fbdef7935d5c85d1.webp 800w, https://blog.kmtea.eu/p/240628-jun-travel-1/img/20240601-170112_hu_8d605b963b3ba968.webp 1600w, https://blog.kmtea.eu/p/240628-jun-travel-1/img/20240601-170112_hu_c95655a306dcea8d.webp 2400w, https://blog.kmtea.eu/p/240628-jun-travel-1/img/20240601-170112.webp 4000w" width="4000"&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&#10;&lt;p&gt;晚上去跟f批面了&lt;/p&gt;&#10;&lt;h2 id="6月2日"&gt;6月2日&#10;&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;p&gt;睡到快中午才醒&lt;/p&gt;&#10;&lt;p&gt;决定坐地铁去绍兴看看&lt;/p&gt;&#10;&lt;p&gt;坐到了自闭座，爽&lt;/p&gt;&#10;&lt;p&gt;&lt;img class="gallery-image" data-flex-basis="180px" data-flex-grow="75" height="4000" loading="lazy" sizes="(max-width: 767px) calc(100vw - 30px), (max-width: 1023px) 700px, (max-width: 1279px) 950px, 1232px" src="https://blog.kmtea.eu/p/240628-jun-travel-1/img/20240602-140348.webp" srcset="https://blog.kmtea.eu/p/240628-jun-travel-1/img/20240602-140348_hu_901efdd28a3c73b9.webp 800w, https://blog.kmtea.eu/p/240628-jun-travel-1/img/20240602-140348_hu_9330635f5fbe1be4.webp 1600w, https://blog.kmtea.eu/p/240628-jun-travel-1/img/20240602-140348_hu_46c58894afb79fd5.webp 2400w, https://blog.kmtea.eu/p/240628-jun-travel-1/img/20240602-140348.webp 3000w" width="3000"&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&#10;&lt;p&gt;到了&lt;/p&gt;&#10;&lt;p&gt;芝士孔乙己&lt;/p&gt;&#10;&lt;p&gt;&lt;img class="gallery-image" data-flex-basis="320px" data-flex-grow="133" height="3000" loading="lazy" sizes="(max-width: 767px) calc(100vw - 30px), (max-width: 1023px) 700px, (max-width: 1279px) 950px, 1232px" src="https://blog.kmtea.eu/p/240628-jun-travel-1/img/20240602-152647.webp" srcset="https://blog.kmtea.eu/p/240628-jun-travel-1/img/20240602-152647_hu_13382b9122187da3.webp 800w, https://blog.kmtea.eu/p/240628-jun-travel-1/img/20240602-152647_hu_ab32298a2f4c1ad0.webp 1600w, https://blog.kmtea.eu/p/240628-jun-travel-1/img/20240602-152647_hu_b79177181d59cdc4.webp 2400w, https://blog.kmtea.eu/p/240628-jun-travel-1/img/20240602-152647.webp 4000w" width="4000"&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&#10;&lt;p&gt;芝士三味书屋&lt;/p&gt;&#10;&lt;p&gt;&lt;img class="gallery-image" data-flex-basis="320px" data-flex-grow="133" height="3000" loading="lazy" sizes="(max-width: 767px) calc(100vw - 30px), (max-width: 1023px) 700px, (max-width: 1279px) 950px, 1232px" src="https://blog.kmtea.eu/p/240628-jun-travel-1/img/20240602-164802.webp" srcset="https://blog.kmtea.eu/p/240628-jun-travel-1/img/20240602-164802_hu_4367a639a1f37750.webp 800w, https://blog.kmtea.eu/p/240628-jun-travel-1/img/20240602-164802_hu_b8782aed7f7f5dd.webp 1600w, https://blog.kmtea.eu/p/240628-jun-travel-1/img/20240602-164802_hu_166d0442d0b180b3.webp 2400w, https://blog.kmtea.eu/p/240628-jun-travel-1/img/20240602-164802.webp 4000w" width="4000"&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&#10;&lt;p&gt;芝士门口&lt;/p&gt;&#10;&lt;p&gt;&lt;img class="gallery-image" data-flex-basis="426px" data-flex-grow="177" height="2250" loading="lazy" sizes="(max-width: 767px) calc(100vw - 30px), (max-width: 1023px) 700px, (max-width: 1279px) 950px, 1232px" src="https://blog.kmtea.eu/p/240628-jun-travel-1/img/20240602-165322.webp" srcset="https://blog.kmtea.eu/p/240628-jun-travel-1/img/20240602-165322_hu_5721a7c3b59ab732.webp 800w, https://blog.kmtea.eu/p/240628-jun-travel-1/img/20240602-165322_hu_39ddb64b183f3ebe.webp 1600w, https://blog.kmtea.eu/p/240628-jun-travel-1/img/20240602-165322_hu_2bc1fde944c50cb7.webp 2400w, https://blog.kmtea.eu/p/240628-jun-travel-1/img/20240602-165322.webp 4000w" width="4000"&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&#10;&lt;p&gt;于是回去了&lt;/p&gt;&#10;&lt;p&gt;晚上看了下钱塘江夜景&lt;/p&gt;&#10;&lt;p&gt;&lt;img class="gallery-image" data-flex-basis="573px" data-flex-grow="238" height="1674" loading="lazy" sizes="(max-width: 767px) calc(100vw - 30px), (max-width: 1023px) 700px, (max-width: 1279px) 950px, 1232px" src="https://blog.kmtea.eu/p/240628-jun-travel-1/img/20240602-220502.webp" srcset="https://blog.kmtea.eu/p/240628-jun-travel-1/img/20240602-220502_hu_952b7c79f7828e26.webp 800w, https://blog.kmtea.eu/p/240628-jun-travel-1/img/20240602-220502_hu_139149bf3f95df12.webp 1600w, https://blog.kmtea.eu/p/240628-jun-travel-1/img/20240602-220502_hu_112f4419b51c6c89.webp 2400w, https://blog.kmtea.eu/p/240628-jun-travel-1/img/20240602-220502.webp 4000w" width="4000"&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&#10;&lt;h2 id="6月3日"&gt;6月3日&#10;&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;p&gt;今天去古镇一日游&lt;/p&gt;&#10;&lt;p&gt;先去乌镇&lt;/p&gt;&#10;&lt;p&gt;&lt;img class="gallery-image" data-flex-basis="180px" data-flex-grow="75" height="4000" loading="lazy" sizes="(max-width: 767px) calc(100vw - 30px), (max-width: 1023px) 700px, (max-width: 1279px) 950px, 1232px" src="https://blog.kmtea.eu/p/240628-jun-travel-1/img/20240603-100721.webp" srcset="https://blog.kmtea.eu/p/240628-jun-travel-1/img/20240603-100721_hu_16530cbce7f6eaaf.webp 800w, https://blog.kmtea.eu/p/240628-jun-travel-1/img/20240603-100721_hu_948522ff10a7b434.webp 1600w, https://blog.kmtea.eu/p/240628-jun-travel-1/img/20240603-100721_hu_55e45348fda67429.webp 2400w, https://blog.kmtea.eu/p/240628-jun-travel-1/img/20240603-100721.webp 3000w" width="3000"&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&#10;&lt;p&gt;中午的半强制消费&lt;/p&gt;&#10;&lt;p&gt;这点￥70&lt;/p&gt;&#10;&lt;p&gt;&lt;img class="gallery-image" data-flex-basis="320px" data-flex-grow="133" height="3000" loading="lazy" sizes="(max-width: 767px) calc(100vw - 30px), (max-width: 1023px) 700px, (max-width: 1279px) 950px, 1232px" src="https://blog.kmtea.eu/p/240628-jun-travel-1/img/20240603-120852.webp" srcset="https://blog.kmtea.eu/p/240628-jun-travel-1/img/20240603-120852_hu_a83baff6604ce767.webp 800w, https://blog.kmtea.eu/p/240628-jun-travel-1/img/20240603-120852_hu_677e4135e28563e6.webp 1600w, https://blog.kmtea.eu/p/240628-jun-travel-1/img/20240603-120852_hu_74aaa34d5f9a024d.webp 2400w, https://blog.kmtea.eu/p/240628-jun-travel-1/img/20240603-120852.webp 4000w" width="4000"&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&#10;&lt;p&gt;普通的木房子，普通的河，普通的桥，普通的船&lt;/p&gt;&#10;&lt;p&gt;&lt;img class="gallery-image" data-flex-basis="320px" data-flex-grow="133" height="3000" loading="lazy" sizes="(max-width: 767px) calc(100vw - 30px), (max-width: 1023px) 700px, (max-width: 1279px) 950px, 1232px" src="https://blog.kmtea.eu/p/240628-jun-travel-1/img/20240603-131512.webp" srcset="https://blog.kmtea.eu/p/240628-jun-travel-1/img/20240603-131512_hu_ff0af841b0c1e7.webp 800w, https://blog.kmtea.eu/p/240628-jun-travel-1/img/20240603-131512_hu_fde73fc14e13dc7e.webp 1600w, https://blog.kmtea.eu/p/240628-jun-travel-1/img/20240603-131512_hu_3f0fcddb69722533.webp 2400w, https://blog.kmtea.eu/p/240628-jun-travel-1/img/20240603-131512.webp 4000w" width="4000"&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&#10;&lt;p&gt;感觉跟我外婆乡下没什么区别&lt;/p&gt;&#10;&lt;p&gt;&lt;img class="gallery-image" data-flex-basis="180px" data-flex-grow="75" height="4000" loading="lazy" sizes="(max-width: 767px) calc(100vw - 30px), (max-width: 1023px) 700px, (max-width: 1279px) 950px, 1232px" src="https://blog.kmtea.eu/p/240628-jun-travel-1/img/20240603-13335